  "historyNote": "#2234, eff 1-1-83; ss by #2930, eff 12-21-84, EXPIRED: 12-21-90 New. #5146, eff 5-6-91; ss by #6504, INTERIM, eff 5-5-97, EXPIRES: 9-2-97; ss by #6566, eff 9-2-97, EXPIRED: 9-2-05 New. #8470, INTERIM, eff 11-1-05, EXPIRED: 4-30-06 New. #8625, eff 5-6-06; renumbered by #10081 (formerly Emp 305.01); ss by #10673, eff 9-22-14; ss by #14317, eff 7-15-25, EXPIRES: 7-15-35",
